      "features": [],
      "notes": [
        "The eccentric guides are designed to complement an endoscopic ACL",
        "reconstruction technique by precisely positioning either a 2-pin passer or the",
        "tunnel notcher.",
        "The tunnel notcher removes a 1.5mm deep pathway of cancellous bone adjacent",
        "to the femoral tunnel. This vacant pathway will enhance guidewire placement and",
        "facilitate easier screw insertion."
